    <selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="f32c47dc-b932-5db8-9d5a-1081a29f05d4" name="H-8 “KRANESCA” (Inexperienced)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" type="min" id="af440bd3-1527-5763-ad07-d2117f6bfb7c" /><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" type="max" id="88902d50-00e5-57e7-be88-d027873fc946" /></constraints><rules><rule id="298c36aa-3094-4672-987a-8db047de3890" name="Damage Value"><description>8+ (light tank).</description></rule><rule id="81cd4455-9acc-4875-acab-f31f67ee829d" name="HE"><description>Instead of having a rating of 1”, the 40mm anti-tank gun’s HE shell has a rating of 2”.</description></rule><rule id="c436fd7c-f8e5-4ec5-b351-68c711bb2943" name="Manoeuvrable design"><description>This unit doesn’t suffer the -1 to-hit penalty when firing on the move, unless it boosts.</description></rule><rule id="3920400e-1797-4540-b629-9e495d0846c7" name="Boost"><description>When this unit Advances, before resolving movement, you may declare a boost. After the first move, immediately perform another move if able; you cannot fire between the moves. At the end of the activation change its Advance order die to Run and roll: 1 or less — Out of fuel, immediately immobilised but may continue to fire; 2 — Fuel low, may make one more non-boosted move after this round then runs out of fuel; 3+ — Fuel OK. Apply -1 for inexperienced crew and +1 for veteran crew.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry>
